{"book":"numbers","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-30T00:06:20.714654417Z","verse":14,"ref":"numbers 16:14","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":16,"translation":"Moreover, ⟨you have⟩ not brought us to a land flowing with milk and honey, nor given us an inheritance of fields and vineyards. Will you bore out the eyes of those men? We will not come up!”","tokens":[{"surface":"אף","gloss":"moreover"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"into"},{"surface":"ארץ","gloss":"a land"},{"surface":"זבת","gloss":"flowing"},{"surface":"חלב","gloss":"with milk"},{"surface":"ודבש","gloss":"and honey"},{"surface":"הביאתנו","gloss":"you brought us"},{"surface":"ותתן","gloss":"nor given"},{"surface":"לנו","gloss":"us"},{"surface":"נחלת","gloss":"an inheritance"},{"surface":"שדה","gloss":"of fields"},{"surface":"וכרם","gloss":"and vineyards"},{"surface":"העיני","gloss":"the eyes of"},{"surface":"האנשים","gloss":"the men"},{"surface":"ההם","gloss":"those"},{"surface":"תנקר","gloss":"will you bore out"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"נעלה","gloss":"we will come up"}]}